ync: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git checkout &#x3C;branch> &#x26;&#x26; git pull`\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Tag format: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`grep -A1 \"tags:\" .github/workflows/&#x3C;project>-release.yml`\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Current version: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`node -p \"require('./package.json').version\"`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (in project dir)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Tag exists?: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git ls-remote --tags origin \"&#x3C;project>-v$CURRENT\"`\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Bump (if tag exists): \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`npm version patch --no-git-tag-version`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (in project dir)\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ship (bumped): \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git add … &#x26;&#x26; git commit … &#x26;&#x26; git push &#x26;&#x26; git tag … &#x26;&#x26; git push origin &#x3C;tag>`\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Tag only (already bumped): \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git tag &#x3C;project>-v$CURRENT &#x26;&#x26; git push origin &#x3C;project>-v$CURRENT`\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Gotchas\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Production fixes on a maintenance line do not use this flow.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> If \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`RELEASE_MAINTENANCE_BRANCHES`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is set, or the repo has branches like \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`release/*`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> that production runs from, a fix for production goes to that branch and is tagged there. A tag cut from \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`&#x3C;branch>`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ships unreleased features. Stop and ask which line the release targets.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Check the tag before bumping.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> If \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`package.json`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">'s current version has no tag on the remote, the bump was already done manually. Only tag it, don't bump again. Re-bumping skips a version and ships the wrong number.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Pushing to \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`&#x3C;branch>`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> directly is allowed only for the version-bump commit.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Feature work always goes through a PR. If CI blocks direct pushes, stop and ask. In the tag-only path there is no new commit to push at all.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Always verify the tag format from CI**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, not from memory. Prefixes vary per project (\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`api-v…`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`web-v…`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, etc.) and a wrong tag silently fails to trigger the publish workflow.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`npm version`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> without \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`--no-git-tag-version`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> creates an unprefixed \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`v1.2.3`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tag and commits it. That is wrong for monorepos. Always pass the flag.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Stage only \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`package.json`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> and \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`package-lock.json`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Don't \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`git add -A`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">. There may be untracked artifacts in the working tree.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Bump type defaults to patch.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Only use minor/major when the user says so or the change is clearly breaking.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Do not ask for confirmation.**\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Invoking this skill is the authorization. Run the full chain (bump, commit, push, tag, push tag) without pausing.\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>",[26,35,43],{"slug":27,"kind":3,"description":28,"keywords":29},"adr-template","Write or review ADRs that cover the hard parts: contracts, failure modes, observability, migration and rollback.",[30,31,32,33,34],"adr","architecture","design","documentation","decisions",{"slug":36,"kind":3,"description":37,"keywords":38},"comment-cleanup","Tightens the code comments in a reviewed diff against your project's comment policy, as the tail of a code review.",[